flowchart LR
  UE[IMS UE / untrusted media] --> CSCF[P/I/S-CSCF]
  CSCF --> AS[SIP AS: validate anchored SDP]
  CSCF --> RTP[RTPengine only media authority]
  RTP --> VA[Voice Agent: bounded transient state]
  AS -->|authenticated control| VA
  AS -->|minimal authenticated event| MA[Media Adapter: NET_RAW only]
  MA -->|authenticated aggregate| AI[AI Worker]
  TOKEN[Generated control-token volume] --> AS
  TOKEN --> VA
  TOKEN --> MA
  TOKEN --> AI
  SECRETS[Subscriber secrets by least exposure] --> UE
  SECRETS --> DB[Provisioning]
